github.com/decred/dcrd/dcrec/secp256k1/v4 (ISC License) for secp256k1.

Package jose/sdjwt is ported from two projects licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Each ported
file starts with a header naming its source files. The code was rewritten in
Go, not copied; the deliberate differences are listed in the package docs.

